BloodPressure: every form its examples take (area 19, "Changing a standard type's encoding")
encoding 1
column systolic numeric(38, 3) -- Pressure in pascals (Pa)
column diastolic numeric(38, 3) -- Pressure in pascals (Pa)

example {"systolic":{"value":"120","unit":"mmHg"},"diastolic":{"value":"80","unit":"mmHg"}}
text none
json {"systolic":{"value":"15998.686","unit":"Pa"},"diastolic":{"value":"10665.791","unit":"Pa"}}
stored systolic 15998.686
stored diastolic 10665.791

